.title{i18n: "defaultChangelogHead"}
%span 2026.07.30 - 1.0.0 - OrniFlight
%ul
  %li Rebrand: stripped all Betaflight references — OrniFlight 1.0
  %li
    ONDAS: 3-channel renamed (cadence, ferocity, balance) + 6 new params (ferocity_p, ferocity_roll, ferocity_yaw, warp, warp_yaw, anchor, resonance)
  %li Firmware Flasher: online loading from dantiel/orniflight releases
  %li NW.js 0.114.0 native ARM64, macOS 26 compatible
  %li Single-window launch, menu click fix
%hr
%span 2024.06.28 - 10.7.0 - OrniFlight
