%span 2019.04.10 - 10.5.0 - BetaFlight
%ul
  %li
    Fixes:
    %ul
      %li fixed header bar wrapping on small screens
      %li fixed the PID tab layout
      %li various other UI fixes
  %li
    New GUI support for the following firmware features:
    %ul
